{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/Capsule_920_430.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>You've suddenly become the balance director of a TCG company.<br>To avoid being fired,<br>you must boost sales through card releases and balance adjustments to meet your quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/GOMCAM_20250318_1110370173.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Balance the card game!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the TCG operator and decide which cards to release or banned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/GOMCAM_20250621_1908160017.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Resell cards!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy banned cards cheaply in advance, lift the bans, and sell them at high prices to make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Get more cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your profits to open booster packs and collect more cards and enhancement effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Prove it in battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win card battles to change your deck's evaluation and silence player complaints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><br>Can you revive the card game and satisfy both the strict chairman and the demanding players?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569850?t=1750561812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569850?t=1750561812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/3a91226ae5cb269da7bb2580f23893036b5dff8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750561812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/3a91226ae5cb269da7bb2580f23893036b5dff8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750561812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/Capsule_920_430.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>You've suddenly become the balance director of a TCG company.<br>To avoid being fired,<br>you must boost sales through card releases and balance adjustments to meet your quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/GOMCAM_20250318_1110370173.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Balance the card game!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the TCG operator and decide which cards to release or banned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/GOMCAM_20250621_1908160017.png?t=1750561812\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>R